{"parse": {"title": "Cave goblin (monster)", "pageid": 16969, "revid": 15229939, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{External|rs}}\n{{HasTask|Goblins}}\n{{Confuse|Cave goblin (Dorgesh-Kaan)}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|version1 = Blue\n|version2 = Beige\n|version3 = Brown\n|version4 = Backpack\n|name = Cave goblin\n|image1 = [[File:Cave goblin (monster, blue).png|160px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Cave goblin (monster, beige).png|160px]]\n|image3 = [[File:Cave goblin (monster, brown).png|160px]]\n|image4 = [[File:Cave goblin (monster, backpack).png|160px]]\n|release = [[14 March]] [[2005]]\n|update = Lumbridge Swamp Caves\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 3\n|size = 1\n|examine = A goblin with big bulging eyes.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|flatarmour = 0\n|max hit = 1\n|aggressive = No\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Crush]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|respawn = 50\n|slayxp = 10\n|cat = Goblins\n|assignedby = turael,spria\n|hitpoints = 10\n|att = 1\n|str = 1\n|def = 1\n|mage = 1\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 0\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|elementalweaknesstype = Fire\n|elementalweaknesspercent = 40\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id1 = 6434\n|id2 = 6435\n|id3 = 6436\n|id4 = 6437\n}}\n{{Synced switch|version1=[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead.png|left]]|version2=[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead.png|left]]|version3=[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead.png|left]]|version4=[[File:Cave goblin (monster, backpack) chathead.png|left]]}}\n'''Cave goblins''' are [[goblin (race)|goblins]] of the [[Dorgeshuun]] who can be found in the [[Lumbridge Swamp Caves]]. They are friendly creatures and are willing to give many adventurers a [[lit torch]] (if the player has no light source) or a [[tinderbox]] (if the player does not have one) when spoken to after the player assures that they are not there to hurt the cave goblins. Upon being attacked, they will scream \"Nooo!\", \"Don't hurt us!\" or \"Eeek!\", and other nearby Cave goblins will try and flee.\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Cave goblin (monster)\n|location = [[Lumbridge Swamp Caves]]\n|levels = 3\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = 12\n|plane = 0\n|x:3246,y:9581|x:3247,y:9558|x:3253,y:9565|x:3256,y:9572\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = misthalin\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=163776}}\n\n{{Average drop value}}\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes and ammunition===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Body rune|quantity=7|rarity=5/50}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=6|rarity=5/50}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=4|rarity=5/50}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Coins===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=5|rarity=4/50|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=9|rarity=4/50|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=15|rarity=6/50|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=20|rarity=5/50|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=1|rarity=1/50|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Nothing|rarity=6/50}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Hammer|quantity=1|rarity=4/50}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Brass necklace|quantity=1|rarity=1/50}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Tinderbox|quantity=1|rarity=4/50}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Cave goblin skull|quantity=1|rarity=1/4|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Cave goblin skulls are only dropped during [[Rag and Bone Man II]].</ref>|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=beginner|rarity=1/64}}\n{{DropsLineClue|type=easy|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Goblin champion scroll|quantity=1|rarity=1/5000|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n==Dialogue rewards==\nThe following items can be obtained in dialogue with the cave goblins if the player is not already holding them.\n\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Lit torch|quantity=1|rarity=Always|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Awarded through dialogue only if the player does not have a torch.</ref>|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsLineReward|name=Tinderbox|quantity=1|rarity=Always|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Awarded through dialogue only if the player does not have a tinderbox.</ref>}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n==Dialogue==\n{{hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 25 June 2025\n|update = Summer Sweep Up: Combat\n|change = Cave goblins now have a 40% elemental weakness to [[fire spells]].\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 9 February 2022\n|update = Land of the Goblins\n|change = A number of items from the NPC's drop table were removed with the release of [[Land of the Goblins]]. These include items that the [[Dorgeshuun]] would not have been able to canonically acquire, such as the [[goblin book]] and [[air talisman]].\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 20 March 2007\n|update = Dorgesh-Kaan\n|change = The NPCs were graphically updated with the release of Dorgesh-Kaan.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n===Gallery (historical)===\n<tabber>\nBlue=\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster 1) (historical).png|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster, blue).png|300x150px]]\n|-\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead (historical).png]]\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead.png]]\n|-\n|14 March 2005 –<br/>20 March 2007\n|20 March 2007 –<br/>present\n|}\n|-|\nBeige=\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster 2) (historical).png|300x150px]]\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster, beige).png|300x150px]]\n|-\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead (historical).png]]\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster) chathead.png]]\n|-\n|14 March 2005 –<br/>20 March 2007\n|20 March 2007 –<br/>present\n|}\n|-|\nBrown=\n{|style=\"text-align: center\" cellpadding=\"15\"\n|[[File:Cave goblin (monster 3) (historical).png|300x15